    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lo-Fi Room is a hidden object &amp; rhythm game where you build lo-fi beats by finding instruments and playing their loops one at a time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a relaxing day of music, make &amp; share your own beats and play endless procedurally generated beats. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Instruments!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/7d26f7c25a4880eeb094d8e41b327fa1.poster.avif?t=1754210671\" width=464 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/7d26f7c25a4880eeb094d8e41b327fa1.webm?t=1754210671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/7d26f7c25a4880eeb094d8e41b327fa1.mp4?t=1754210671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play The Beats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/203930122451d40eb4758eaf5fcdcccb.poster.avif?t=1754210671\" width=464 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/203930122451d40eb4758eaf5fcdcccb.webm?t=1754210671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/203930122451d40eb4758eaf5fcdcccb.mp4?t=1754210671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Music!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2980020/extras/7745d910910ccbf937